<title>USA: Oskaloosa, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 00:11 21/11]</title>
<headline>Oskaloosa, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 00:11 21/11]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $2 million of Oskaloosa, Iowa, local option sales and services tax revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost (corrects from &quot;net interest cost&quot;) of 4.861 percent (corrects from &quot;4.8895 percent&quot;).</p>
</text>
